mcp-computer-use
================

This product was seeded from injaneity/pi-computer-use
(https://github.com/injaneity/pi-computer-use), licensed under the MIT license.
The Swift helper at native/macos/bridge.swift started as a copy of upstream
commit 96434a7 (v0.1.1) and has been extended here. The file, the IPC
protocol, and the command surface are owned by this project going forward —
we do NOT commit to wire compatibility with the upstream and expect to
diverge as agent needs evolve.

The Node-side TypeScript (src/native/macos-bridge.ts) is a clean
re-implementation tailored to the MCP server lifecycle and safety model of
this project.

